<title>USA: Medical Resources completes acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Medical Resources completes acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Resources Inc said on Tuesday it completed the acquisition of two magnetic resonance imaging centers for $6.4 million.</p>
<p>Payment for the centers, located in New York, entail a combination of $1.9 million in cash and $4.5 million of common stock.</p>
<p>Medical Resources specializes in the operation and acquisition of diagnostic imaging centers.</p>
